edit('CLM-000620','/statement_zh','本地系统工件、活动充分性与时间判别分别需要特征变体、有效会话动作及原生时间对照，据此推断三个稳定Niji边界。平台、API、沙箱产品及纯等待不自动形成相同分类。')
edit('CLM-000620','/statement_en','Local system artifacts, activity sufficiency, and temporal judgment require feature variants, valid session actions, and native-time controls respectively, supporting an inference of three stable Niji boundaries. Platforms, APIs, sandbox products, and pure waits do not automatically define these partitions.')
edit('CLM-000620','/evidence_refs',['REF-000410','REF-000443','REF-000444','REF-000445','REF-000625'])
edit('CLM-000655','/evidence_refs',['REF-000410','REF-000443','REF-000444','REF-000625'])
edit('CLM-000656','/statement_zh','程序可把活动存在性、近期性或动作充分性用于分析环境判断并门控核心功能，部分实现还检查节奏或位置；据此推断人类活动充分性门控边界，自然度不是所有实现的必要条件。')
edit('CLM-000656','/statement_en','Programs can use activity presence, recency, or action sufficiency for analysis-environment judgment and core-function gating; some also check cadence or position. This supports an inferred Human-Activity Sufficiency Gating boundary without requiring naturalness in every implementation.')
edit('CLM-000656','/evidence_refs',['REF-000410','REF-000443','REF-000625','REF-000907'])
edit('CLM-000657','/statement_zh','报告样本以运行时间比较控制早退并在修改返回后继续，据此推断时间真实性校验边界。单纯sleep、timer/message计数或RDTSC等待不独立证明环境判别，多时钟实现需要另证比较及后继链。')
edit('CLM-000657','/statement_en','A reported sample uses uptime comparison to control early exit and continues after changed returns, supporting an inferred Temporal Realism Verification boundary. Sleep, timer/message counting, or RDTSC waiting alone does not establish environment judgment; multiclock implementations require separate comparison and successor evidence.')
