edit('CASE-000164','/description_zh','Mandiant的IRONGATE样本分析记录部分dropper在匹配VMware或Cuckoo工件后不部署scada.exe。放行仍需特定网络资源路径，且不自动执行搬移文件。来源认为可能是测试、PoC或研究，感染途径及行动归属未知；2014年上传与2015年发现是样本沿革，不是已知操作日期。')
edit('CASE-000164','/description_en','Mandiant’s IRONGATE analysis records some droppers withholding scada.exe deployment after VMware or Cuckoo matches. Release still requires a specific network-resource path and does not automatically execute the relocated file. The source considers testing, PoC, or research possible, with unknown infection route and attribution. Uploads in 2014 and discovery in 2015 are sample history, not established operation dates.')
edit('CASE-000165','/actor_or_campaign','Upatre samples analyzed by Unit 42')
edit('CASE-000165','/description_zh','Unit 42报告Upatre样本将GetTickCount与0xAFE74（720500毫秒）比较，低值时早退；改变返回uptime后继续恶意例程。这证明报告样本的时间证据、比较与后继链，不证明全部变体或通用有效性。DWORD约49.7天回绕，低值也可能来自真实启动或回绕。报告发表于2015-10-06，操作日期与目标行业未知。')
edit('CASE-000165','/description_en','Unit 42 reports an Upatre sample comparing GetTickCount with 0xAFE74 (720500 milliseconds) and exiting at low values, then continuing its malicious routine after changed returned uptime. This establishes the reported sample’s timing evidence, comparison, and successor chain, not all variants or universal effectiveness. The DWORD wraps after about 49.7 days, so low values can reflect real boot or wrap. The report was published on 2015-10-06; operation dates and target sectors are unknown.')
edit('CASE-000165','/evidence_refs',['REF-000445',TICK])
edit('REF-000410','/notes_zh','保留此v19网页出版物身份；2026-11-08下载时页面实际标示ATT&CK v19.2。辅助支持父行为，不作本批固定19.1证明；固定范围使用REF-000625及本批本地提取，不能合并两项身份。')
edit('REF-000410','/notes_en','Preserve this v19 web-publication identity. The page downloaded on 2026-11-08 labels itself ATT&CK v19.2. It corroborates parent behavior without proving fixed 19.1 scope; use REF-000625 and this batch extraction and keep their identities distinct.')
