edit('REF-000443','/notes_zh','原文支持系统工件和活动门控类别及分析平台对策。Figure 8 timer/message与Figure 9 RDTSC循环主要展示等待，不独立证明多时钟真实性比较及其受控因果效果。Niji分类与具体实验合同为研究推断。')
edit('REF-000443','/notes_en','The text supports system-artifact and activity-gating classes and analysis-platform countermeasures. Figure 8 timer/message waits and Figure 9 RDTSC loops chiefly show waiting, not independent proof of multiclock realism comparison or its controlled causal effect. Niji classification and specific experiment contracts remain research inferences.')
